  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Stafford House is the English-language school division of CATS Global Schools, with four UK centres: London, Brighton, Cambridge, and Canterbury.",
      "Stafford House offers General English (Standard / Intensive / Super Intensive — 15/22.5/30 hours/week), IELTS preparation, Cambridge Exam preparation (FCE / CAE), Business English, Professional Certificates (Business Management / Marketing / Project Management), CELTA teacher training (full-time / part-time / online), and One-to-One English.",
      "Stafford House Study Holidays — junior summer programmes (ages 11-17) at Canterbury: Classic English Course (15 hrs/week), Intensive English (23 hrs/week), Classic Plus Basketball, Careers in Medicine Programme, Model United Nations Programme.",
      "All centres offer accommodation: residence + homestay options, prices from £180/week (Canterbury) to £1,300/month (London)."
    ],
